			"notes": "Changelog\n\n- Added profile search and filtering for quickly finding profiles in long lists.\n- Added context-aware profile auto-switching, including automatic profile switching when joining configured servers.\n- Added support for Minecraft 26.1 and 26.1.2.\n- Fixed profile list refresh after creating, renaming, or deleting profiles.\n- Fixed profile management UI layout issues, overlapping labels, and unstable button positioning when resizing the game window.\n- Fixed the profiles folder button not opening the profiles directory.\n- Fixed rendering issues on newer Minecraft versions, including transparent text and duplicate blur crashes.\n- Improved profile management screen usability, validation messages, and translations."
		},
